                "text": "Another day has passed without Washington Republicans making progress on extending the ACA tax credits. This uncertainty is unfair to families who are already stretched thin during the holidays. \n\nNo one should have to weigh their children\u2019s presents against their health insurance bill. Republicans need to come to the table.",
