                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "If Trump and Washington Republicans continue to refuse to join Democrats in extending the ACA premium tax credits before January, millions will see health care costs double or triple. Many will be priced out of coverage completely. This affects real people. Republicans need to work with us before it\u2019s too late.\nhttps://t.co/cBysw6Be4M",
