                "retweet_count": 13,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "I am excited to reintroduce my Health Insurance Premium Fairness Act with @RepLindaSanchez to lower health insurance costs for households who are enrolled in both Medicare and ACA plans.\n\nThis bill closes a loophole that raises costs for married couples when one spouse ages into Medicare and the other stays on the ACA plan.\n\nLet\u2019s get it done!",
