                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Making health care more affordable and accessible has always been a top priority of mine. That\u2019s why @RepLindaSanchez and I reintroduced our Health Insurance Premium Fairness Act to bring down costs for families enrolled in both Medicare and ACA programs. https://t.co/WgFbBeaNLY",
