                "retweet_count": 12,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "In just 20 days, the ACA premium tax credits are set to expire. Washington Republicans still have no plan to address this health care crisis \u2013 instead of simply extending the credits, they are willing to let millions of Americans stay in limbo on whether their premiums will double. Unacceptable.\n\nhttps://t.co/KZUsUNq9xK",
