                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 194,
                "retweet_count": 21,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Millions of Americans are just days away from huge premium spikes \u2013 some more than DOUBLING. American families are already stretched too thin. It\u2019s time for Washington Republicans to act NOW so we can extend ACA tax credits and prevent a health care crisis before it\u2019s too late.",
