                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "The Health Insurance Premium Fairness Act, which I reintroduced with @RepLindaSanchez, will close a loophole in the ACA and prevent premiums from skyrocketing when one family member ages into Medicare and the other remains on an ACA plan. We need to improve the ACA and protect seniors\u2019 health care.",
