                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Time is running out to extend ACA tax credits \u2014 and Washington Republicans still have NO plan to address the health care crisis they created. This is an emergency. We need to act NOW before millions of Americans are priced out of health coverage altogether.",
