                "text": "We are days away from the expiration of the ACA tax credits, and Washington Republicans still have no plan to stop this looming disaster. Millions of people across the country are about to see their health care costs skyrocket or lose coverage all together. This is NOT the holiday gift Americans want.\n\nInstead of taking action, my Republican colleagues are adding financial uncertainty and chaos to the lives of the American people at a time when they simply cannot afford it.\nhttps://t.co/m2rVcQocrk",
