                "text": "Trump\u2019s economic approval rating is lower than it\u2019s ever been, and the reasons couldn't be clearer. Families across the country are struggling to keep up with skyrocketing electric bills, climbing health care costs, and groceries that just keep getting more expensive. Nearly half of Americans now say the rising cost of living is their biggest concern.\n\nTrump promised to lower costs on Day 1. What happened? Reckless tariffs and baseless economic decisions are doing the exact opposite.\nhttps://t.co/GhudvZm5SM",
